# HERO7: the climax, every slop option on: e1m3's last hall at skill 3 (nightmare). The
# two fiends at the exit's skull arch wake to the player's first rocket and charge; each
# death teleports the next fiend in (the map's own trigger chain), and the last two dead
# bring the shambler. The player stands in the hall's south-east aisle under the large
# flames on the east wall (eye 1600,400,582), its own eye (`camera walk`: the game's own
# movement and bob), turning to the nearest fiend it sees and firing rockets while the
# view is on one more than 200 units away (`aim monsters ... fire 200`), so no blast hurts
# it and no rocket is fired at nothing. Full slop, the status bar scaled and overlaid, the
# gun, crosshair 1, Brightness 0.8. The first rocket's blast wakes the fiends; the `wake`
# lines at 2 s are part of this fight (the game is chaotic: without them it is another).
#
# The fight runs 14 s from film second 0; `frames 91..648` writes the window 2.517 to
# 9.797 s (7.28 s) with a second of handle each end (the game runs from frame 0 either
# way). It opens on the second rocket's blast at the arch, the fiends already charging;
# four fiends die in it (shot seconds 0.53, 2.90, 3.83, 7.13), and it ends 0.15 s into the
# fourth's blast. The shambler teleports in 0.2 s after, in the tail.
#
# No narration: it follows V4-47, "And that's the slop preset, switched on.", whose "on"
# is the cut to it.

map e1m3
skill 3
warmup 1
wake 1288,920,560 at 2
wake 1408,920,560 at 2

duration 14
frames 91..648
fps 60
size 1920x1080

preset slop
hud on
gun on
crosshair 1
notarget off
cvar gamma 0.8

camera walk within 160
key 0 1600,400,582 at 1380,940,600
key 14 1600,400,582 at 1380,940,600
aim monsters from 1 fire 200

impulse 9

# Measuring aids, never drawn: the hall's six large flames (light_flame_large_yellow,
# each mark at the flame's middle), the fiends and the shambler.
mark f1 1008,396,688 radius 24
mark f2 1008,652,688 radius 24
mark f3 1008,884,688 radius 24
mark f4 1686,396,688 radius 24
mark f5 1686,652,688 radius 24
mark f6 1686,884,688 radius 24
mark d0 entity monster_demon1#0
mark d1 entity monster_demon1#1
mark d2 entity monster_demon1#2
mark d3 entity monster_demon1#3
mark sh entity monster_shambler#0

sound on
events on
